{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Auto-RPG: Tower Walker is a fresh relaxing incremental <strong>idle game</strong> rich with features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies with the <strong>Automatic realtime combat</strong> using Melee, Ranged and Magic skills inspired by oldschool RPGs. <strong>Level up</strong> your character. <strong>Loot</strong> equipment. <strong>Defeat</strong> powerful <strong>bosses</strong>. Make impactful decisions. Grow stronger. Progress up in the tower. Craft. Upgrade and Enchant the loot. <strong>Reach the endgame</strong> and test your character in Normal/Heroic/Brutal mode raid <strong>dungeons</strong>. This is an idle RPG experience unlike any other. Begin your journey today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/5712e84f38b065270d9b21175c1b919e.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Choose between a wide variety of classes. Level up your character and learn new skills at the trainer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/b63a61ca966bbe6c8cb8e91f5d776cc8.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Ultimate Auto-RPG is an idle game that mostly plays on its own. Your hero will <strong>automatically defeat enemies</strong> and <strong>level up</strong> on your screen while you do other things. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/638e41da128427cd72eeb755e257b4c8.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Loot equipment, weapons, armor, rings, artifacts and other powerful items. (+800 items)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/a6ee2a780f35c725426bd1bef2d875a1.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Progress up in the ancient tower, explore and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/b2eec92cd955bfde92344770b63d17ec.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Defeat powerful bosses to earn special unique items and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/8cc3065a305de21f245895ba2ce807b9.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Trade with merchants in the basecamp or unlock secret vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/bc94c94be8a260396dbdd998fcb5263c.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Craft items, fully featured recipe based crafting system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/636cb20051632952d9ade0617515cd50.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Learn professions such as alchemy, blacksmithing, fishing, herbalism, cooking and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/9c4f386ea3f49289211a03f8d8adf76f.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Find, collect and level up pets and companions with extra buffs and combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977070/extras/1c1273d1756c9f992a844b38a87c83fb.avif?t=1758184618\" width=762 height=430 /></span>Reach the late-game and progress in raid dungeons to earn legendary items.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explore the tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/f22d49b3ad0338ff91313241107628b8d65c0eb1.jpg"},{"name":"Crafting master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/6a6f4174f01f99de660f33ef4e803d12e3feeb40.jpg"},{"name":"Warrior master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/b4a7d883cbb7f33a51c904e97838f4c1da0ec490.jpg"},{"name":"Rogue master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/362b0864749cb6e90fee5cc7e7176dbf4f9181a2.jpg"},{"name":"Mystic master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/40d7db8cb95df096077fa48224cc77e2169a9168.jpg"},{"name":"Super grade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/a11a59c219197b401fed19a760f2cf8731165e55.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Giant Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/504d5a793fd6c79842bc7672f15a6f10d9f2e97f.jpg"},{"name":"Equip a ring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/cdce1f907eb439dc4a88e504371c1d77971e0855.jpg"},{"name":"Reach the barracks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977070/1bafb46627679d95089ae3bc70c3cbb51bd447fd.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Korgon the slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co